                "description": "The Athena Lever with Square Rosette is available in a wide array of modern finish color options. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Modern Athena Leverset with Square Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors. This door lever will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
